{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0023_1000_049mom", "source_sha256": "bf4cb0d7783b3c002ecc539cad21e17f6a16559f59314bcb4da8cfc8c42cf93c", "ja": "ねえ、お兄ちゃん、起きてるでしょ？\nまだ寝ないよね？", "zh": "欸，大哥哥，你醒着对不对？\n还没睡着吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0023_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fb97d0501c04666c3284e85150be84a635c10caadb6bce3428e793ca9489a440", "ja": "ああ、起きてるけど……\n桃子、今日もまた眠れないのか？", "zh": "嗯，我是醒着……\n桃子，你今天也睡不着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0023_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "baa1cbbc71b53cd37312af7deb874400bb7a0cb4deac6e59437015f5f733db2d", "ja": "うん。おとまり会なんて、初めてだからかな……\nなんだか、ちっとも眠くならなくって。", "zh": "嗯，因为桃子第一次在外面过夜……\n总觉得一点也没有睡意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0023_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4b0fb03febc3d83b6c80c0ccc9da5e0f1091d1c27cff9a494a58b8dcbd52b5f2", "ja": "それは困ったな……2日目だし、そろそろ\n慣れてもらわないとな。明日も朝から仕事だし……。", "zh": "那还真伤脑筋啊……都第二天了，你差不多也该习惯啰。\n明天也是从一大早就要开始工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0023_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "51ad48e4172dd16b71879ab2c8ba32d9b322e224d3464407120356924a799e42", "ja": "もう、それくらいわかってるよ。\n寝不足でも仕事はちゃんとやるんだから、安心して。", "zh": "真是的，这点事桃子晓得啦。\n就算睡眠不足，桃子也会好好工作的，你放心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0023_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "2381a40ba42679feea495281ab265e153f3342c2f66ed7d209ea59e5e885f67e", "ja": "だから、もう少し……\n眠くなるまで、話、してもいい？", "zh": "所以说，再一下下……\n等到桃子想睡为止，能陪桃子说说话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0023_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f8f4c98e2ed2c07af914d7ec2ce3d6034a465a0d479b2caea04f09aad9f4c24f", "ja": "じゃあ、眠くなるまでな。\n昼間はどうだった？　楽しめたか？", "zh": "那就只到你想睡为止喔。\n白天过得怎么样？开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0023_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "af4c38c0460ab58b91d1e7eb8b48fe4498ab585ba6c03cbaf3015e7ac45a9a79", "ja": "うん！　みんな一緒で、楽しかったよ。\nケーキも、おいしかったなぁ……。", "zh": "嗯！跟大家在一起，桃子很开心喔。\n蛋糕也好好吃啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0023_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "40e210096ecd8bb34f9ad46593cd0a06b64009d96c8dbbe47705d403a436dd2a", "ja": "桃子、学校のおとまり行事は、仕事で出られなかったし\n……べ、別に、出たいとも思わなかったけど。", "zh": "学校办的外宿活动，桃子都因为工作没办法参加……\n虽、虽然桃子也没有特别想参加啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0023_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "b6191f4a9f7a526df81dcd98cc01ee96783a025ad65f2aa2dcd26c637d10de6c", "ja": "でも、みんなと一緒も……たまになら悪くないね。", "zh": "但是，偶尔像这样和大家待在一起……也不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0023_1010_p", "source_sha256": "94c48f18a7eb3a556a52c506692bef2ce63bdb18bc15e94b23792a7063893f34", "ja": "そうか。これからは、そういう機会が増えるよ。\nもっともっと、楽しいことができるといいな。", "zh": "这样啊。以后还会有更多这种机会喔，\n希望你能多体验一些开心的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0023_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "2ab1a6a57e6933613658c3431fd5dae717f3a48af76ddd96030bd233be25e7e0", "ja": "うん……こんな日が、毎日……続くのかな……。\n……すぅー……。", "zh": "嗯……像这样的日子，会每天……持续下去吗……\n……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
